- Job & Bid types, RoleContext for Client/Pilot view switching
- calculateProviderScore(): real weighted scoring engine (distance, rating,
  badge tier, credibility, response time) per the spec's exact bands
- Post a Job form: title, description w/ word counter, category picker,
  date/time, hours stepper, photo upload (up to 5), live budget calc,
  Urgent/Regular toggle with validation
- Client Bidding Dashboard: live countdown, simulated live bids, Top 3
  Recommended (real computed scores), View All Offers with sort/filter,
  No Bids Found state w/ restart + convert-to-regular, Cancel Job,
  pre-assignment chat
- Provider Bidding view: Client Snapshot, job detail, Submit/Modify/Cancel
  bid with +/- quick price adjustments, match-score preview

Jobs tab list is role-aware: Client sees own posted jobs + Post button,
Provider sees Available/My Bids/Active Jobs filtered feed.
